==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|naph}}, from {{inh|de|goh|hnaph}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*hnappaz}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|nap}}, {{cog|en|nappy}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/napf/|[napf]|[napɸ]|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m||gen2=Napfes|Näpfe|Näpfchen}}

# small [[bowl]]; [[cup]]; {{non-gloss definition|now chiefly to hold fodder for animals}}

